# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: TORCS.
Package: TORCS
Section: Games
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport
Components: Apps.Games.!TORCS (Movable LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-torcs
Description: The Open Racing Car Simulator, a 3D racing game
 Software OpenGL racing (riscos-mesa) in a desktop window or full
 screen, with nine tracks and Debian's free cars. About 10 frames a
 second on a Pi 4; needs a fast ARMv7 machine with NEON and about
 64 MB free.
Build-Map: !TORCS -> Apps/Games/!TORCS
Build-Untyped: auto
